# The app's data files are parsed byte for byte - dex.lua and egg.lua anchor
# their field patterns with $ - and LittleFS receives exactly what git checked
# out. A CRLF working tree therefore ships a dex.txt the badge cannot read, and
# the failure looks like "expected 36 species, found 0" rather than anything to
# do with line endings. Everything text here is LF, on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.bin binary
*.pal binary
